### R4 | USER właściciel (Jan) | POST /api/buildings -> 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/buildings
Authorization: Bearer {{jan.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Budynek C", "address": "ul. Testowa 1, Kraków" }

### R4 | USER obcy (Anna) | POST /api/buildings -> 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/buildings
Authorization: Bearer {{anna.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Budynek C", "address": "ul. Testowa 1, Kraków" }

### R4 | ADMIN | POST /api/buildings -> 201
# @name createdBuilding
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/buildings
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Budynek C", "address": "ul. Testowa 1, Kraków" }

########## R5: PATCH /api/buildings/:id
