PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/buildings/{{createdBuilding.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jan.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "address": "ul. Zmieniona 2, Kraków" }

### R5 | USER obcy (Anna) | PATCH /api/buildings/:id -> 403
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/buildings/{{createdBuilding.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{anna.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "address": "ul. Zmieniona 2, Kraków" }

### R5 | ADMIN | PATCH /api/buildings/:id -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/buildings/{{createdBuilding.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "address": "ul. Zmieniona 2, Kraków" }

